@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+The output of ``pytest --fixtures`` (and ``--fixtures-per-test``) now shows the scope
+of each fixture, for example ``fixture_name [session]``. Fixtures using the default
+``function`` scope don't show a scope to keep the output concise.
